<title>HUNGARY: Hungary to auction 7yr bonds of HUF8bln on Nov 21.</title>
<headline>Hungary to auction 7yr bonds of HUF8bln on Nov 21.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary will auction 8 billion forint worth of the seven-year government bonds of 2003/F series on November 21, the Government Debt Management Agency (AKK) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Date of issue		17 October, 1996</p>
<p>    Date of maturity	   24, September 2003</p>
<p>    Bills on offer	     8,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Minimum net price	  101.72 pct</p>
<p>NOTE -  The bond bears a floating interest, calculated on March 20 and September 20 every year adding three percent to year-on-year consumer inflation. The interest is paid once a year, on September 24. The starting interest is 25.9 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
